Task: Using the activity log table, compute the total number of unique user sessions where each web page appears as either a landing page (the first page visited in a session based on timestamp) or an exit page (the last page visited in a session based on timestamp), or both. Count each session only once per page even if the page serves as both landing and exit for that session. 

